{%- doc -%}
  Loads the shared landing page stylesheet (`assets/lp-core.css`).

  Every `sections/lp-*.liquid` module renders this first so the section works on
  any template, including when dropped into a standard page. Repeat renders emit
  duplicate <link> tags, which browsers resolve to a single cached request.

  @example
  {% render 'lp-styles' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

